{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S01-S02较多停留在离开后的空落和对旧日自在生活的怀念，维持尊严的行动与归属感的交织尚未充分展开。\",\n    \"部分段落仍偏向反复权衡是否回去、是否后悔，具体如何在怀念中坚持尊严的行动主要到S11-S13才逐渐明确。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S08只写搁置去留后回忆亲近时光带来的暖意，没有像X那样明确表现怀念并未使他想回头，弱化了怀念与坚持不再受委屈之间的同时存在。\",\n    \"S09把想回去的原因改写成舍不得以前的生活或难受时想有人陪，缩窄了Center中的归属感，也把尊严与怀念的冲突转成了对孤独和陪伴的顾虑。\",\n    \"S13更多落在未来孤单、何时有人亲近的担忧上，相比X对再次获得归属的期待，略偏向孤独感本身。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更完整地保留了两股力量的相互牵扯：他怀念被当作自己人的生活，却不愿为了找回陪伴而重新忍受委屈；尤其S09直接把归属渴望与可能再次牺牲尊严联系起来。Y则在S09将核心冲突部分替换成了对孤独和陪伴的顾虑，因此X更贴近Center。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "75553c95-3d83-4a61-a1e2-d0b05d296809", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T093651682058Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:37:10.741763+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "eb19518e03d07c2c147974dd4a4b1a04396fc83c03b1fd9479a80198bac54059", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_s